{"seq":1,"slug":"gsap-engineering","title":"GSAP 工程实践：timeline、ScrollTrigger 与性能优先原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-animation-engineering/libraries/gsap-engineering","wordCount":687,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"gsap-工程实践-timeline-scrolltrigger-与性能优先原则\">GSAP 工程实践：timeline、ScrollTrigger 与性能优先原则</h1><p>GSAP（GreenSock Animation Platform）是前端动画生态中功能最完整的时间轴引擎。它的核心价值在于：精确的时间轴编排、跨浏览器一致性、以及在复杂场景下优于原生 API 的性能表现。本文覆盖 GSAP 工程实践中的关键模式和易错点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gsap-核心-api\">GSAP 核心 API</h2><h3 id=\"gsap-to-gsap-from-gsap-fromto\">gsap.to / gsap.from / gsap.fromTo</h3><p>GSAP 的三个基础补间方法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import { gsap } from &#39;gsap&#39;;&#10;&#10;// gsap.to：从当前值过渡到目标值&#10;gsap.to(&#39;.card&#39;, {&#10;  x: 200, // 等价于 translateX(200px)，GSAP 自动使用 transform&#10;  opacity: 0.5,&#10;  duration: 0.6,&#10;  ease: &#39;power2.out&#39;,&#10;});&#10;&#10;// gsap.from：从指定值过渡到当前值（入场动画常用）&#10;gsap.from(&#39;.hero-title&#39;, {&#10;  y: -50,&#10;  opacity: 0,&#10;  duration: 0.8,&#10;  ease: &#39;back.out(1.7)&#39;,&#10;});&#10;&#10;// gsap.fromTo：完全控制起始和结束状态&#10;gsap.fromTo(&#10;  &#39;.element&#39;,&#10;  { scaleX: 0, transformOrigin: &#39;left center&#39; }, // from&#10;  { scaleX: 1, duration: 0.5, ease: &#39;power3.inOut&#39; }, // to&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { gsap } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'gsap'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// gsap.to：从当前值过渡到目标值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gsap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.card'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  x: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 等价于 translateX(200px)，GSAP 自动使用 transform</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  opacity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ease: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'power2.out'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// gsap.from：从指定值过渡到当前值（入场动画常用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gsap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.hero-title'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  y: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  opacity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ease: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'back.out(1.7)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// gsap.fromTo：完全控制起始和结束状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gsap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fromTo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '.element'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { scaleX: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, transformOrigin: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'left center'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// from</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { scaleX: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ease: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'power3.inOut'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// to</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>GSAP 的单位处理</strong>：GSAP 优先使用 <code>transform</code> 属性——<code>x</code>/<code>y</code>/<code>rotation</code>/<code>scale</code> 等简写属性会自动映射到对应的 transform 函数，避免手写 <code>transform: translateX()</code> 字符串时的合并问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"gsap-缓动函数系统\">GSAP 缓动函数系统</h3><p>GSAP 提供比 CSS 更丰富的缓动库：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缓动类型</th>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Power</td>\n<td><code>power1.out</code>、<code>power4.in</code></td>\n<td>多项式，数字越大越强烈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Back</td>\n<td><code>back.out(1.7)</code></td>\n<td>超射效果，参数控制幅度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Elastic</td>\n<td><code>elastic.out(1, 0.3)</code></td>\n<td>弹性振荡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bounce</td>\n<td><code>bounce.out</code></td>\n<td>弹跳效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sine</td>\n<td><code>sine.in</code></td>\n<td>正弦曲线，最平滑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Expo</td>\n<td><code>expo.out</code></td>\n<td>指数，快起慢收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Circ</td>\n<td><code>circ.in</code></td>\n<td>圆形曲线</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"gsap-timeline-时间轴编排\">GSAP Timeline：时间轴编排</h2><p><code>Timeline</code> 是 GSAP 的核心特性，将多个补间组织成有序序列：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const tl = gsap.timeline({&#10;  defaults: { duration: 0.6, ease: &#39;power2.out&#39; },&#10;  onComplete: () =&gt; console.log(&#39;动画序列完成&#39;),&#10;  paused: true, // 默认暂停，手动触发&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 默认：前一个动画结束后开始&#10;tl.from(&#39;.hero-title&#39;, { y: -30, opacity: 0 })&#10;  .from(&#39;.hero-subtitle&#39;, { y: -20, opacity: 0 })&#10;  .from(&#39;.hero-cta&#39;, { scale: 0.8, opacity: 0 });&#10;&#10;// 相对定位：在上一个结束前 0.2s 开始（交错效果）&#10;tl.from(&#39;.card&#39;, { x: -20, opacity: 0 }, &#39;-=0.2&#39;);&#10;&#10;// 绝对时间：在 1.5s 时开始&#10;tl.from(&#39;.badge&#39;, { scale: 0, opacity: 0 }, 1.5);&#10;&#10;// 标签：命名时间点&#10;tl.addLabel(&#39;reveal&#39;, 2)&#10;  .from(&#39;.content&#39;, { y: 30, opacity: 0 }, &#39;reveal&#39;)&#10;  .from(&#39;.sidebar&#39;, { x: 30, opacity: 0 }, &#39;reveal+=0.1&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gsap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">timeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  defaults: { duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ease: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'power2.out'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  onComplete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'动画序列完成'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  paused: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 默认暂停，手动触发</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 默认：前一个动画结束后开始</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.hero-title'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { y: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, opacity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.hero-subtitle'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { y: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, opacity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"